# Local-only state of the .opencode folder.
#
# Everything else in this folder is shared with every clone of the repo:
# commands/ and authored skills define the agent workflow, and committing
# them keeps OpenCode, Codex, Claude Code and human collaborators on the
# same working rules.
#
# NOT committed:
# - the provider API key and the config referencing it
# - installed third-party skills (re-installable, large binaries,
#   upstream-owned — e.g. the impeccable skill ships a 19 MB exe)
# - tool working state

# provider credentials / local configuration
orthos-key
opencode.json
opencode.jsonc

# installed (not authored) skills — re-install them instead of committing
skills/claude-frontend-design/
skills/impeccable/

# tool working state
.impeccable/
